That chat you've been meaning to reply to since Monday? Yeah, that one. This week's leaderboard has three new builds, and a couple of them might be calling you out a little.

@teni built Stay In Touch (stay-in-touch-kit.lovable.app), a tool for everyone whose "I'll text them later" somehow turned into three weeks. It helps you schedule calls and visits with the people who matter and keeps a shared history so the relationship actually gets nurtured, not just remembered.

@maadandev shipped NextRole NG (nextroleng.tech), a full-stack AI CV optimizer that reads your CV the way a Nigerian recruiter actually would. No fake 90% confidence score, it just tells you the truth about why you're not getting callbacks and shows you exactly what to fix.

And @omare dropped Inspirational Women (lumen-women.vercel.app), a gallery-style project honouring the women whose discipline and mindset changed how they think and spend their days. Worth entering just to scroll through it slowly.

The leaderboard resets Friday, so if one of these deserves your vote, go cast it now.
